## Framework: SolidJS + SolidStart

This project uses **SolidJS** (not React). Key differences:
- Use `createSignal`, `createMemo`, `createEffect` (not useState, useMemo, useEffect)
- Components don't re-render - signals update reactively
- Use `<Show>`, `<For>`, `<Switch>` for conditional/list rendering
- Props are accessed directly, not destructured at call site (preserves reactivity)
- Use `onMount` / `onCleanup` for lifecycle

## Package Management

Use **pnpm** for all package operations:
```bash
pnpm install          # Install dependencies
pnpm add <package>    # Add new package
pnpm dev              # Start dev server
```

## UI Components

Use **Solid-UI** (ShadCN port for SolidJS) for new UI elements:
- Docs: https://www.solid-ui.com/docs/cli
- Check existing components in `src/components/ui/` before adding new ones
- Follow established patterns in `src/components/Vote/` for game UI

## Testing

- Include unit tests for new utility functions (Vitest)
- Add `data-testid` attributes for E2E test selectors
- Ensure existing tests pass after changes: `pnpm test`
